        "AbstractText": "The purpose of this article is to address the isolated causes of osseous central metatarsalgia that are related to an elongated metatarsal and brachymetatarsalgia. The authors focus on surgically addressing shortened and elongated metatarsals, surgical complications, and revisional surgery."
